{"content":[{"c":["JEHOSHAPHAT, Valley of"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Valley mentioned in prophecy as the place of future judgment (",{"href":"?bref=Joel.3.2,12","r":"Joel.3.2,12","rawR":"Joel.3.2,12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Joel.3.2,12","value":"Joel.3.2,12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jl 3:2, 12"},"), sometimes called the valley of decision (v ",{"href":"?bref=Joel.3.14","r":"Joel.3.14","rawR":"Joel.3.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Joel.3.14","value":"Joel.3.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"14"},"). Its exact location is disputed. Some (notably Jerome) identify it with the Kidron Valley, east of Jerusalem, pointing to early Christian tradition; others prefer the valley of Hinnom, south of Jerusalem. This tradition may be traced back through Eusebius to the book of 1 Enoch (1 Enoch 53:1). Still others say the name is symbolic and refers only to coming judgment, not to a specific place."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"JehoshaphatValleyof","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jl 3:2, 12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Joel.3.2,12","rawQueryValue":"Joel.3.2,12","sourceRefExact":"Joel.3.2,12"},{"anchorText":"14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Joel.3.14","rawQueryValue":"Joel.3.14","sourceRefExact":"Joel.3.14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e2d4a8e2173d1c56385804087913dedb81860071f786b92f7e6dc9a0402e6296","sourceItemName":"JehoshaphatValleyof","sourceItemOrder":156,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"JehoshaphatValleyof","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jehoshaphat, Valley of","title":"Jehoshaphat, Valley of","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}